Follower and following results are interactive entities.

You can open a profile by clicking:

The account avatar
Display name
Username
Open Profile button

The profile opens inside the authenticated X session, allowing you to inspect the real account immediately.

This avoids manually copying usernames from the extracted dataset back into a browser.

9. Follower and following search

Extracted network records can be searched locally by:

Username
Display name
Biography
Relationship type
Source account

This can help locate:

Shared organizations
Geographic references
Repeated slogans
Occupation terms
